{"content_html": "<html><body><div> <div> <figure> <img alt=\"tp-1.jpg\" src=\"https://cdn.tienphong.vn/images/13ecad0ef8180c81acd49efd487b0a8e83b095b9d36774c542699cea804bbd12750fe3c6afde50d2077acacdee595bdb/tp-1.jpg.avif\"/> </figure> <figure> <img alt=\"tp-2.jpg\" src=\"https://cdn.tienphong.vn/images/13ecad0ef8180c81acd49efd487b0a8e83b095b9d36774c542699cea804bbd12e16e929c14ca5c7cedc58a8c9fad5f50/tp-2.jpg.avif\"/> </figure> <figure> <img alt=\"tp-3.jpg\" src=\"https://cdn.tienphong.vn/images/13ecad0ef8180c81acd49efd487b0a8e83b095b9d36774c542699cea804bbd12b0895ad418d9f36654db705e3850ac7a/tp-3.jpg.avif\"/> </figure> <figcaption> Đường thôn Mỹ Thôn, xã Gia Bình luôn tấp nập các phương tiện hỗ trợ vận chuyển đồ đạc của người dân đến nơi ở mới để nhường chỗ cho dự án <a href=\"https://tienphong.vn/bac-ninh-se-co-khu-thuong-mai-tu-do-5000-ha-gan-voi-san-bay-gia-binh-post1850183.tpo\">sân bay Gia Bình</a>. </figcaption>\n</div>\n<div> <figure> <img alt=\"tp-6.jpg\" src=\"https://cdn.tienphong.vn/images/13ecad0ef8180c81acd49efd487b0a8e83b095b9d36774c542699cea804bbd12a0dde75b0c08d1788056fcde6f283a5d/tp-6.jpg.avif\"/> </figure> <figure> <img alt=\"tp-4.jpg\" src=\"https://cdn.tienphong.vn/images/13ecad0ef8180c81acd49efd487b0a8e83b095b9d36774c542699cea804bbd1200f5f83084325bef51d149776385d70a/tp-4.jpg.avif\"/> </figure> <figcaption> Người dân thôn <a href=\"https://tienphong.vn/bac-ninh-se-co-khu-thuong-mai-tu-do-5000-ha-gan-voi-san-bay-gia-binh-post1850183.tpo\">Mỹ Thôn</a> tháo dỡ nhà cửa để nhường đất cho dự án sân bay Gia Bình. </figcaption>\n</div>\n<figure> <img alt=\"tp-14.jpg\" src=\"https://cdn.tienphong.vn/images/13ecad0ef8180c81acd49efd487b0a8e83b095b9d36774c542699cea804bbd122ea13f75be21c80adb896e4884e38f08f0ca7ea95604f1801b5908427e7f00fe/tp-14.jpg.avif\" title=\"Một ngôi nhà đang tháo dỡ.\"/> <figcaption>Một ngôi nhà đang tháo dỡ.</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<div> <figure> <img alt=\"tp-11.jpg\" src=\"https://cdn.tienphong.vn/images/13ecad0ef8180c81acd49efd487b0a8e83b095b9d36774c542699cea804bbd12d30e8c9144de606b8594a05af97d16a2f0ca7ea95604f1801b5908427e7f00fe/tp-11.jpg.avif\"/> </figure> <figure> <img alt=\"tp-12.jpg\" src=\"https://cdn.tienphong.vn/images/13ecad0ef8180c81acd49efd487b0a8e83b095b9d36774c542699cea804bbd12581b3402236d3bf61f2956a416d932adf0ca7ea95604f1801b5908427e7f00fe/tp-12.jpg.avif\"/> </figure> <figure> <img alt=\"tp-15.jpg\" src=\"https://cdn.tienphong.vn/images/13ecad0ef8180c81acd49efd487b0a8e83b095b9d36774c542699cea804bbd12c6ef7e7ffc2e96b1b4c911e6475beb74f0ca7ea95604f1801b5908427e7f00fe/tp-15.jpg.avif\"/> </figure> <figcaption>Dù trời nắng nóng, nhưng công việc tháo dỡ nhà cửa vẫn làm khẩn trương.</figcaption>\n</div>\n\n<div> <figure> <img alt=\"tp-7.jpg\" src=\"https://cdn.tienphong.vn/images/13ecad0ef8180c81acd49efd487b0a8e83b095b9d36774c542699cea804bbd12f1305208b886fc51373a71004617ef41/tp-7.jpg.avif\"/> </figure> <figure> <img alt=\"tp-17.jpg\" src=\"https://cdn.tienphong.vn/images/13ecad0ef8180c81acd49efd487b0a8e83b095b9d36774c542699cea804bbd120ced5679525fc62c9d57f4525b9f39ccf0ca7ea95604f1801b5908427e7f00fe/tp-17.jpg.avif\"/> </figure> <figcaption> Hàng trăm hộ dân ở thôn Mỹ Thôn đồng loạt di dời đến nơi ở mới phục vụ giải phóng mặt bằng dự án <a href=\"https://tienphong.vn/them-khu-tai-dinh-cu-phuc-vu-du-an-san-bay-gia-binh-post1840668.tpo\">sân bay Gia Bình</a>. </figcaption>\n</div>\n<div> <figure> <img alt=\"tp-16.jpg\" src=\"https://cdn.tienphong.vn/images/13ecad0ef8180c81acd49efd487b0a8e83b095b9d36774c542699cea804bbd12aee9bd611646a1e13b43123daece7bbcf0ca7ea95604f1801b5908427e7f00fe/tp-16.jpg.avif\"/> </figure> <figure> <img alt=\"tp-8.jpg\" src=\"https://cdn.tienphong.vn/images/13ecad0ef8180c81acd49efd487b0a8e83b095b9d36774c542699cea804bbd12575ec3879b8a29d657bff58327af5120/tp-8.jpg.avif\"/> </figure> <figure> <img alt=\"tp-18.jpg\" src=\"https://cdn.tienphong.vn/images/13ecad0ef8180c81acd49efd487b0a8e83b095b9d36774c542699cea804bbd126c88fb2c30929dca1ddb711ca202a825f0ca7ea95604f1801b5908427e7f00fe/tp-18.jpg.avif\"/> </figure> <figcaption>Trên các tuyến đường nhộn nhịp hoạt động vận chuyển đồ đạc.</figcaption>\n</div>\n<figure> <img alt=\"tp-19.jpg\" src=\"https://cdn.tienphong.vn/images/13ecad0ef8180c81acd49efd487b0a8e83b095b9d36774c542699cea804bbd1251c9671d96da7d85ee1e4e897738d333f0ca7ea95604f1801b5908427e7f00fe/tp-19.jpg.avif\" title=\"Một ngôi nhà gỗ đang tháo dỡ.\"/> <figcaption>Một ngôi nhà gỗ đang tháo dỡ.</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<div> <figure> <img alt=\"tp-21.jpg\" src=\"https://cdn.tienphong.vn/images/13ecad0ef8180c81acd49efd487b0a8e83b095b9d36774c542699cea804bbd12d86167d0fb3fd934ff0936c35f7eb5abf0ca7ea95604f1801b5908427e7f00fe/tp-21.jpg.avif\"/> </figure> <figure> <img alt=\"tp-20.jpg\" src=\"https://cdn.tienphong.vn/images/13ecad0ef8180c81acd49efd487b0a8e83b095b9d36774c542699cea804bbd121b74d9adacfc795019f904b53a30555bf0ca7ea95604f1801b5908427e7f00fe/tp-20.jpg.avif\"/> </figure> <figure> <img alt=\"tp-22.jpg\" src=\"https://cdn.tienphong.vn/images/13ecad0ef8180c81acd49efd487b0a8e83b095b9d36774c542699cea804bbd122ed4fd77e7b62c09c0c9f768f08f1d58f0ca7ea95604f1801b5908427e7f00fe/tp-22.jpg.avif\"/> </figure> <figcaption> Quân đội và <a href=\"https://tienphong.vn/doan-vien-thanh-nien-doi-nang-ho-tro-nguoi-dan-di-doi-tai-san-nhuong-cho-cho-san-bay-gia-binh-post1850244.tpo\">đoàn viên</a> giúp người dân tháo dỡ nhà. </figcaption>\n</div>\n\n<div> <figure> <img alt=\"tp-26.jpg\" src=\"https://cdn.tienphong.vn/images/13ecad0ef8180c81acd49efd487b0a8e83b095b9d36774c542699cea804bbd1262ca4b48915bc9624b236838c4dafb5bf0ca7ea95604f1801b5908427e7f00fe/tp-26.jpg.avif\"/> </figure> <figure> <img alt=\"tp-24.jpg\" src=\"https://cdn.tienphong.vn/images/13ecad0ef8180c81acd49efd487b0a8e83b095b9d36774c542699cea804bbd1224a12112447adafd61510c1991f9e9cff0ca7ea95604f1801b5908427e7f00fe/tp-24.jpg.avif\"/> </figure> <figure> <img alt=\"tp-27.jpg\" src=\"https://cdn.tienphong.vn/images/13ecad0ef8180c81acd49efd487b0a8e83b095b9d36774c542699cea804bbd129d5b1ac62c5136a96115e2a4a0a039b3